 form is\n\n$$\n2{y}_{1}^{2}+6{y}_{2}^{2},\\,{\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}={x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}={x}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, from left to right, the missing parts are as follows:\n\n$\\,$ $2\\,$ and $\\,{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}.$" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379084 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379085 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379086 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379087 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379088 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1041 "selection" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379084 13194139536003 true] [17592186379083 1110 #uuid "21ff659b-1664-5cf5-ac6b-8c2df62d69a7" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379084 1034 "$2$ and ${x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}$" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379084 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536003 true] [17592186379084 1111 #uuid "62c29d18-b7ad-5791-8c03-010ac438d1c7" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379085 1034 "$2$ and ${x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}$" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379085 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536003 true] [17592186379085 1111 #uuid "afdb44de-b78f-5507-aa8d-c70bfb219802" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379086 1034 "$2$ and ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}$" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379086 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536003 true] [17592186379086 1111 #uuid "dfe3adfe-57b7-5d0f-ad71-b8d9794a5244" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379087 1034 "$4$ and ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}$" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379087 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536003 true] [17592186379087 1111 #uuid "8ddf4364-5244-5bdd-aa16-ebc15eb6ab10" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379088 1034 "$4$ and ${x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}$" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379088 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536003 true] [17592186379088 1111 #uuid "a4dd6dc8-b571-5f12-91f8-b27a856298aa" 13194139536003 true] [17592186379089 101